7:["$","p",null,{"children":["If a ",["$","code",null,{"className":"rounded bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-fg","children":"Dockerfile"}]," is present, shadw builds the image and runs it as a container (Railway-style). Stateful container singletons use consensus-free leases + fencing, so a node failure triggers automatic failover."]}]
